Subject: [PATCH] arch/dadao: implement PTW faults and A/D bits (KL-127a)

---
 src/arch/dadao/decoder.cc | 35 +----------------
 src/arch/dadao/isa.cc     | 82 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++----
 src/arch/dadao/isa.hh     | 24 ++++++++++--
 src/arch/dadao/tlb.cc     | 45 +++++++++++----------
